p://client.id" rel=3D"noreferrer noreferrer noreferrer" target=3D"_blank">c=
lient.id</a><br>
and <a href=3D"http://transactional.id" rel=3D"noreferrer noreferrer norefe=
rrer" target=3D"_blank">transactional.id</a>? How do we avoid colliding wit=
h the per-thread<br>
