Hello all,

Thanks for the feedback,

I have opened a new discussion thread to discuss changing the=20
default reset policy from latest to by_duration:PT5S.
<https://lists.apache.org/thread/njjznyly38td4scb9bjc8v0gq7kc1yqj>

Feedback and comments are very welcome!

Best Regards,
Jiunn-Yang

