> [CVE-2026-54513] , [CVE-2026-54512] [jackson-databind] [2.21.2]
> ---------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-20767
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20767
>             Project: Kafka
