Hi all,

I would like to start a discussion thread for KIP-1363: Add --checkpoint =
option to kafka-metadata-shell and deprecate --snapshot.

The proposal adds `--checkpoint` as the preferred option for =
`kafka-metadata-shell.sh` when selecting the metadata checkpoint file to =
read. The existing `--snapshot` option and `-s` alias will remain =
supported as deprecated aliases for compatibility.

