Subject: [VOTE] KIP-1279: Cluster Mirroring
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"
From: Federico Valeri <fedevaleri@gmail.com>
Reply-To: <dev@kafka.apache.org>

Hello devs, we would like to start a vote for KIP-1279: Cluster Mirroring.

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1279%3A+Cluster+Mirroring

This KIP proposes natively integrating asynchronous cross-cluster
replication directly into Kafka brokers. It enables instant client
failovers without messy offset translation, supports incremental
failbacks, and makes bridge-less KRaft migrations much easier to
manage.

Thanks
Fede

