Subject: [jira] [Created] (KAFKA-20798) Add readOnly(IsolationLevel) to
 TimestampedWindowStoreWithHeaders and SessionStoreWithHeaders
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394
From: "Lucy Liu (Jira)" <jira@apache.org>
