hi all

I noticed an issue regarding the "protected" modifier with this new annotatio=
n. https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21337#discussion_r3574009798

TL;DR: The "protected" modifier seems to be treated as part of the "public" s=
cope for now, so we can't use it to hide [internal details] from users and we=
 need to maintain backward compatibility?

There is another PR (https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/20598) using the sa=
me approach (like CloseOptions), so I'd like to check the best practices for =
@InterfaceAudience.Public before merging it.

Best,
Chia-Ping=20

