Hi Murali,
Thanks for the KIP. I understand the proposal.

AS1: What performance testing have you done to validate whether there is a pe=
rformance impact due to this change? When we get to the point of removing the=
 deprecated configuration, there is a potential behavioural cliff which we sh=
ould have investigated before we get there.

AS2: Is there any reason why you did not follow a similar naming scheme as th=
e existing metadata log configs, such as share.coordinator.max.record.bytes.b=
etween.snapshots?

AS3: I suggest that the broker-level config would be HIGH and the group-level=
 config would be LOW importance.

Thanks,
Andrew

