Hi,=0A=
I'd like to open discussion on KIP-1368: Client framework name and version.=
=0A=
=0A=
Applications often use application frameworks such as Spring to connect to =
Kafka. To assist with problem diagnosis, this KIP introduces a way to provi=
de the framework name and version as part of the metadata the client sends =
to the broker when it connects.=0A=
=0A=
Here's the KIP: https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/J4Q_Gg=0A=
=0A=
Thanks,=0A=
Andrew=

