KRaftClusterTest is a huge test class, and we could slim it down by removing some duplicate tests. For example, I believe testCreateClusterAndCreateListDeleteTopic is already covered by another test in the clients-integration-test module. If I'm wrong, another way would be to rewrite those tests using ClusterInstance and then move them to the clients-integration-test module.



