--------------------------------------

             Summary: Make Time utils class part of the public API
                 Key: KAFKA-20814
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20814
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


the follow-up of KAFKA-17939

The Time interface is already exposed by Metrics, KafkaMetric, and KafkaStreams. It should officially be a public API, but the current interface is too complex. We need a KIP to deprecate internal-facing methods like waitObject, waitForFuture, and the timer methods.



