> >
> >
> > Hi Everyone!
> >
> >
> > I=E2=80=99d like to start a discussion on a KIP for reserving apiKey va=
lues for
> private use.
> >
> >
> > More details at:
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/spaces/KAFKA/pages/440304597/KIP-1367=
+Reserve+apiKey+values+for+private+use
