Hi Chia-Ping,

You are right that @SuppressWarnings is just a temporary workaround.
The fundamental issue remains: in version 5.0, when constructors become
package-private, internal Kafka code in other packages (KafkaProducer,
KafkaAdminClient, etc.) will lose access.

Given these constraints, Sean's minimal public Time interface seems to be
the cleanest solution.

Thanks.

