  {{Thread.UncaughtExceptionHandler}} on the {{StateUpdaterThread}} so any =
uncaught fatal error
  is guaranteed to reach the structured application logs (not just {{System=
.err}}).
* Consider a metric/log line when a {{StreamThread}} misses heartbeats due =
to a stuck
  rebalance-listener callback, to make this diagnosable without a thread du=
mp.

