Hello All,

After a review from Matthias J. Sax and  Alieh Saeedi, we found that
more clarification is needed for clients to prevent regression on
their side.

The KIP has been updated in the deprecation section to be explicit
about the effects and how users should approach migration if they use
headers-full serializers.

Best regards,
Uladzislau Blok

