ere I=E2=80=99ve had to use the admin client to update the offsets.

The main uses cases teams face ( and TIL about the various options the scrip=
t offers):
Teams migrating to a new consumer group from an existing one but don=E2=80=99=
t want to commit to either (or duration for newer clients) auto offset reset=
 policy on the new group.
Teams want to seek past certain offsets in partitions because they have pois=
