Lianet Magrans created KAFKA-20844:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Improve inflightPoll lifecycle handling in the async =
Consumer
                 Key: KAFKA-20844
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20844
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
          Components: clients, consumer
            Reporter: Lianet Magrans
            Assignee: Lianet Magrans


The lifecycle of the inflightPoll is managed across several methods: poll (=
firstPass flag), checkInflightPoll, maybeClearPreviousInflightPoll, maybeCl=
earCurrentInflightPoll, and collectFetch, and the event's progress is track=
ed with a mix of futures and flags, which has proven error-prone. E.g., KAF=
KA-20780 was a case not properly handled (an AsyncPollEvent that completed =
on a non-first pass was not cleared, so no new fetch request was submitted)=
.

This task is to do a high level review to make the flow easier to follow an=
d less error-prone. E.g., maybe explicit states or transitions around the f=
etching lifecycle, also review and better separate responsibilities (actual=
 fetching/buffering, reconciliation, position validations, HB)

=C2=A0



