   The package is now pure ESM (no more CommonJS build), and the default export is now callable directly. <code>ncu.run()</code> and <code>ncu.defineConfig()</code> still work as namespaced properties.</p>
   <ul>
   <li><em>Migration (ESM):</em>
   <pre lang="js"><code>// before
   import * as ncu from 'npm-check-updates'
   const upgraded = await ncu.run({ /* ... */ })
   // after
