    Resolution: Fixed

> Do not fail clients if bootstrap servers is not immediately resolvable
> ----------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-14648
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14648
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Bug
>          Components: clients
>            Reporter: Jason Gustafson
>            Assignee: TengYao Chi
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.4.0
>
>
> In dynamic environments, such as system tests, there is sometimes a delay=
 between when a client is initialized and when the configured bootstrap ser=
vers become available in DNS. Currently clients will fail immediately if no=
ne of the bootstrap servers can resolve. It would be more convenient for th=
ese environments to provide a grace period to give more time for initializa=
tion.=C2=A0



