--------------------------------------

             Summary: Integrate api-checker module into CI
                 Key: KAFKA-20872
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20872
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
