>>>> The project has enough traction that I think of it as its own network client with distributed log semantics for which frameworks are written, much like gRPC over netty. People want to just write the business logic and leave the plumbing and threading to the frameworks.
>>>>
>>>> All of this to say, I’m fine to ship the client framework as the new identifying parameter for frameworks to set. It will be mighty useful.
